# osa-screen-capture-windows.exe — placeholder
#
# The real binary is a native C++/C# application built against the Windows
# Desktop Duplication API (DXGI IDXGIOutputDuplication).
# It has not yet been shipped in this release.
#
# To install the native helper once available:
#   osa opencomputers install-helper
#
# For a pre-release build, contact MIOSA support or see:
#   docs/windows-desktop.md
#
# This file exists so the Elixir helper-lookup path can be exercised in
# tests without a real .exe present.  The Windows.find_helper/0 function
# looks for the .exe extension — this .placeholder file will not match and
# will correctly return {:error, {:missing_helper, _}}.
